<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait court orders new elections in one district.</title>
<headline>Kuwait court orders new elections in one district.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-01-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait's Constitutional Court has ordered fresh elections for two parliamentary seats after uncovering irregularities in an October poll, newspapers reported on Sunday.</p>
<p>Kuwait held elections on October 7 for 50 parliament seats. The fresh elections are expected to be held in the next few weeks.</p>
